OL,3,GNEWSADemolition plan for #2m 'white
OL,4,Aelephant' lagoon
OL,5,
OL,6,FA #2m beach lagoon built largely with
OL,7,Ftaxpayer cash is set to be demolished
OL,8,Fat a cost of #800,000.
OL,10,FThe Three Shells Lagoon opened in July
OL,11,F2026 to create a "sheltered bathing
OL,12,Farea" and sandy beach that Visit
OL,13,FSouthend described as "a popular choice
OL,14,Ffor families".
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,376,370,200,160,0,100
