OL,1,W5j 5Qws js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSADemolition plan for #2m 'white
OL,4,Aelephant' lagoon
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut the Labour-led Southend-on-Sea City
OL,7,FCouncil is set to consider dismantling
OL,8,Fthe lagoon ` which is currently closed
OL,9,Fafter a safety incident earlier this
OL,10,Fyear ` on Monday. Concerns have been
OL,11,Fraised about a pungent smell although
OL,12,Fthe bathing water is rated excellent,
OL,13,Faccording to council papers.
OL,15,FMatt Dent, cabinet member for business
OL,16,Fand tourism, described the lagoon as a
OL,17,F"monstrosity" and said the council
OL,18,Fneeded to "cut our losses".
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
